OL,3,GNEWSA'Use us or lose us', hospitality
OL,4,Afirms warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FPub, cafes and restaurants in
OL,7,FWorcestershire have said they need the
OL,8,Fpublic's support "more than ever" as
OL,9,Fwinter approaches.
OL,11,FAbout 70 businesses joined a special
OL,12,Fsummit organised by Wychavon District
OL,13,FCouncil on Monday, the first event of
OL,14,Fits kind in the area.
OL,16,FThe event was aimed at sharing the
OL,17,Findustry's concerns over areas like
OL,18,Ftax, wages and recruitment, as well as
OL,19,Fdetails of help available from the
OL,20,Fcouncil.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
