OL,3,GNEWSA'Use us or lose us', hospitality
OL,4,Afirms warn
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If you don't support the pubs, some of
OL,7,Fthem won't be here in the spring - I
OL,8,Fknow it's a cliche but I always say
OL,9,F'use it or lose it'," said Brian
OL,10,FIngham, who runs The Anchor pub in Wyre
OL,11,FPiddle.
